{"type": "thinking", "text": "Off. Good.\n\nNow, back to the group editor schedule and Home consistency. There's a potential bug hinted: \"the schedule summary is now generated directly from the same model as the Home tab cards.\" Maybe the summary uses different date logic. We saw Plan card \"Every 2 weeks · Mon/Sat · 7:00 AM\" and Home NOV 16 MON. Let me verify the Plan card summary vs actual next date. \"Every 2 weeks Mon/Sat\" starting Nov 14. If next is Nov 16 Mon, then summary consistent. But wait: is Nov 16 a valid occurrence under \"every 2 weeks\"? If per-weekday anchor, yes Monday first occurrence after start = Nov 16, then +2 weeks. Sat first = Nov 14 (today). So next upcoming is Mon Nov 16. Consistent.\n\nBut hold on—if Saturday repeats every 2 weeks (Nov 14, Nov 28), and Monday repeats every 2 weeks (Nov 16, Nov 30), then the Plan summary \"Every 2 weeks · Mon/Sat\" is arguably right.\n\nHome shows only next: Nov 16. After that Nov 28. OK.\n\nLet me test a trickier one: Weekly with multiple days selected, but interval 1 (normal). Then summary \"Every week · Mon/Sat · 7:00 AM\" and Home tomorrow? Let me not.\n\nBetter test: Night owl mode + time 3:00 AM. The schedule summary/Home may show wrong dates. This is likely where the \"same model\" consistency matters: Home cards apply night owl \"doses before 4 AM count as previous day\". The group editor preview should match.\n\nLet me test: Edit group, set time to 3:00 AM (via time picker) with night owl ON. Preview should show 3:00 AM Today? For Nov 14 3:00 AM with night owl on: \"doses before 4:00 AM count as the previous day\" — meaning a 3 AM dose on Nov 14 counts as Nov 13? Hmm. Actually night owl mode affects which day a dose belongs to for logging. The Home \"today\" card might show dose at 3:00 AM under the previous day. This could be complex.\n\nGiven the hint, maybe there's a clear bug in how the summary is derived. Let me test Daily every 1 day at 7:00 AM: summary should be \"Every day · 7:00 AM\".